PURPOSE
  You may look at, download, and copy this project, and use it privately
  for yourself (including flashing your own Waveshare PhotoPainter).
  You may NOT commercialize it or the product as implemented here
  (no selling, no paid service, no commercial product based on this software).

1. Permitted (non-commercial only)

   You may:
   (a) download this repository;
   (b) make and redistribute exact, unmodified copies;
   (c) run and use the software for personal, private, non-commercial
       purposes only (e.g. flashing your own device, preparing your own
       images in Studio).

2. Not permitted (without prior written permission from the copyright holder)

   You may NOT:
   (a) use the software, or any modified or derived version, for any
       commercial purpose — including but not limited to: selling the
       software; offering it as a paid app, SaaS, or service; bundling it
       in a commercial product; using it to produce paid deliverables or
       commercial image-processing services;
   (b) commercialize the Tintenklecks workflow/product as embodied in this
       codebase (browser Studio → Spectra-6 dither → gallery on the frame)
       by shipping a competing commercial product that is substantially
       based on this code;
   (c) modify, adapt, or create derivative works for distribution or for
       commercial use (private experiments that you do not share or sell
       are tolerated only if they remain strictly personal and are not
       published);
   (d) remove or alter copyright, license, or attribution notices;
   (e) sublicense, sell, or relicense the covered material under other
       terms.

3. No trademark rights

   This license does not grant rights to the name "Tintenklecks" or related
   branding except as needed to identify an exact unmodified copy.

4. No warranty

   THE SOFTWARE AND MATERIALS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
   KIND. THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER IS NOT LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER
   LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE MATERIALS OR THEIR USE OR DISTRIBUTION.

5. Termination

   Any breach of this license terminates your rights automatically.
   Sections 3 and 4 survive termination.

6. Note on ideas vs. code

   Copyright and this license protect this software and its expression.
   They do not monopolize abstract ideas in general. Independently created
   software written from scratch without using this code is outside this
   license — but using this code (or a derivative) commercially is not
   allowed.

